     2→ * SuggestionChips - Tappable habit suggestion pills
     3→ *
     4→ * Features:
     5→ * - Flex wrap layout with centered chips
     6→ * - Selection state with emerald highlight
     7→ * - Hover/press animations
     8→ * - Haptic feedback on selection
