    48→/**
    49→ * Individual suggestion chip with press animations
    50→ *
    51→ * Animation behavior (per spec):
    52→ * - Entrance: fade in + slide up with stagger delay
    53→ * - Hover (onPressIn): translateY -2px, scale 1.05
    54→ * - Press (onPress): triggers selection, brief scale down
    55→ * - Release (onPressOut): animate back to rest state
